"hero": "\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\">{{ppp:breadcrumbs}}<span class=\"eyebrow\">Ellis Services Group · Perth</span><h1>Toilet Installation &amp; Replacement Perth</h1><p class=\"expanded-lead\">Toilet installation and replacement in Perth, including supply of the agreed toilet, removal of the old unit and taking it away. We assess fit, water and waste connections before confirming the installation and written quote.</p><p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=toilet-installation-perth.html\">Arrange a visit &amp; quote</a></p><p class=\"expanded-hours\">Routine service hours: 09:00–21:00, seven days a week. 24-hour emergency repairs are available; call to confirm attendance arrangements and the quoted emergency work. No arrival time is guaranteed.</p><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"expanded-toc\"><a href=\"#service-scope\">Service scope</a><a href=\"#service-scenarios\">Common situations</a><a href=\"#service-quote\">Process &amp; quote</a><a href=\"#service-faq\">FAQs</a></nav></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"sections": [
{
"id": "section-1",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scope\">Toilet installation Perth: service scope</h2><ul><li>Supply and install the agreed toilet suite, remove the existing unit and take it away.</li><li>Check the waste position, water supply, fit and access before settling the scope.</li><li>Identify any changes to connections, floor or wall finishes separately.</li><li>Drain clearing, concealed pipe repairs and bathroom renovation are not automatically part of the toilet installation package.</li></ul><p>We confirm the property, installation and requested outcome before selecting the work. Fixed plumbing and electrical tasks are handled by the appropriate qualified trade; a coordinated visit does not make every task interchangeable. Current documentation relevant to the proposed work can be requested privately.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Perth plumbing services</a></li><li><a href=\"toilet-repairs-perth.html\">Running toilet and cistern repairs</a></li><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Fixture installation overview</a></li><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">Blocked toilet and drain clearing</a></li><li><a href=\"property-management.html\">Rental replacement approvals</a></li><li><a href=\"service-areas.html\">Perth service regions</a></li></ul></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-2",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section expanded-scenarios\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-scenarios\">Common situations and what to report</h2><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>Replacing a toilet rather than a cistern part</h3><p>A continuously refilling cistern may be repairable without replacing the whole toilet. Tell us why you want replacement, including damage, leaks or a planned change. We compare the repair option with the proposed installation instead of treating every running toilet as a replacement job.</p></div><div class=\"expanded-scenario\"><h3>Checking the proposed suite before ordering</h3><p>A new toilet has to suit the existing waste connection, water connection and available space. Photos taken safely may help preparation, but measurements and connection requirements still need assessment. Product selection alone does not establish that it will fit the property.</p></div><p>These are illustrative situations, not customer case studies or diagnoses. Report what you have noticed; you do not need to identify the cause before contacting us.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "section-3",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2 id=\"service-quote\">Assessment, work plan and written quote</h2><ol class=\"expanded-steps\"><li><strong>Describe the job.</strong> Give the suburb, affected equipment or planned installation, when it began and whether the condition is worsening. Add safe access and the person who can approve the work.</li><li><strong>Assess the installation.</strong> We check the relevant equipment and connections on site. Concealed work, product compatibility and the cause of a fault cannot be guaranteed from an enquiry or photograph.</li><li><strong>Agree the scope.</strong> The written quote identifies attendance or investigation, the selected equipment, materials and agreed work. Confirm GST, disposal, access, testing and any making good that applies to the specific job.</li><li><strong>Approve changes separately.</strong> If findings change the required work, we explain the additional scope and charge before proceeding. Confirm the checks and completion information needed for a rental or managed property.</li></ol><p>Published standard-hours guide ranges elsewhere on this site are not a fixed price for this unseen job. Emergency repair charges follow the quoted plan. There is no assumed free attendance, unlimited investigation or universal hourly rate.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Toilet Installation &amp; Replacement Perth FAQs</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Prepare the request and approval</h3><p>Give the property location, observable symptoms or intended installation, access contact and the person who can approve the work. The agreed quote sets out the assessment and work; submitting a form does not reserve an appointment.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Perth plumbing services</a></li><li><a href=\"toilet-repairs-perth.html\">Running toilet and cistern repairs</a></li><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">Fixture installation overview</a></li><li><a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">Blocked toilet and drain clearing</a></li><li><a href=\"property-management.html\">Rental replacement approvals</a></li></ul></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
